DocStudioFamilyHelpPdf = The preview of Dolibarr shows the PDF in the viewer of the browser: search, thumbnails and print, but the JavaScript, forms and links of the PDF may be active depending on the browser, and on phones the PDF is often downloaded instead. The viewer of DocStudio never runs the JavaScript of the PDF, keeps its forms and links inactive, and shows it the same way on computers and phones. This choice applies to the magnifier of the lists only: the download link still opens the file in the browser.
DocStudioFamilyHelpImage = The viewer of DocStudio always shows an SVG as a plain image: its scripts never run.
